{"2547710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Risky pizza delivery", "steam_appid": 2547710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RISKY PIZZA DELIVERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to three friends work for the only delivery service desperate  enough to go anywhere. Your route tonight takes you somewhere abandoned and scary </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in. Find the drop point. Don't let whatever lives here find you first.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/42f677eebcaccd1380abddebfa44c512.poster.avif?t=1781514430\" width=1008 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/42f677eebcaccd1380abddebfa44c512.webm?t=1781514430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/42f677eebcaccd1380abddebfa44c512.mp4?t=1781514430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op survival horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed from the ground up for 1–4 players online. Every run is more survivable with teammates — and far more terrifying when they go quiet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/626219e1cb13bee87da0dba994c7b572.poster.avif?t=1781514430\" width=1008 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/626219e1cb13bee87da0dba994c7b572.webm?t=1781514430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/626219e1cb13bee87da0dba994c7b572.mp4?t=1781514430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stalking, adaptive monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The things inside don't patrol. They hunt. Each creature has its own behavior, senses, and temper. Learn the rules of each location or learn what happens when you don't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/82a94e7781184681a984b61336a1160d.poster.avif?t=1781514430\" width=1008 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/82a94e7781184681a984b61336a1160d.webm?t=1781514430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/82a94e7781184681a984b61336a1160d.mp4?t=1781514430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Backrooms-style environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality, atmospheric levels oppressive lighting, layered ambient sound, and enough visual fidelity to make you believe the walls are real</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/5bba83571284c09f51b977c139f30b5b.avif?t=1781514430\" width=1440 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some doors won't open by themselves. Some floors shouldn't be crossed. Solve what stands between you and the exit  ideally before something else catches up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Proximity voice chat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to your team in real time. Hear them get closer. Hear them get farther. Stop hearing them altogether. Integrated proximity voice means distance matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is different</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawns, obstacles, and monster behavior shift each session. No two deliveries are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RISKY PIZZA DELIVERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to three friends work for the only delivery service desperate  enough to go anywhere. Your route tonight takes you somewhere abandoned and scary </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in. Find the drop point. Don't let whatever lives here find you first.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/42f677eebcaccd1380abddebfa44c512.poster.avif?t=1781514430\" width=1008 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/42f677eebcaccd1380abddebfa44c512.webm?t=1781514430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/42f677eebcaccd1380abddebfa44c512.mp4?t=1781514430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op survival horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed from the ground up for 1–4 players online. Every run is more survivable with teammates — and far more terrifying when they go quiet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/extras/626219e1cb13bee87da0dba994c7b572.poster.avif?t=1781514430\" width=1008 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_