at</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to your team in real time. Hear them get closer. Hear them get farther. Stop hearing them altogether. Integrated proximity voice means distance matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is different</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawns, obstacles, and monster behavior shift each session. No two deliveries are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "An online co-op horror game with up to 4 players. Brave the endless, abandoned places to deliver fresh orders to locations no sane person would enter, complete every drop-off and get out alive, or risk becoming a permanent resident.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/c8f8620b5698695742aad8e961f152e2c20f044d/header.jpg?t=1781514430", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/577aaca282f893879d9da1abb5f54c0af421626b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781514430", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547710/577aaca282f893879d9da1abb5f54c0af421626b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781514430", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 or AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 730/Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any DirectX-compatible device<br><